[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3001\u5F85\u3061\u307E\u3057\u305F\u308F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana, I\u0027ve been waiting for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063\u3002\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u304A\u7236\u3055\u3093\u306E\u8A71\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Is this about my father?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308C\u304B\u3089\u95A2\u9023\u66F8\u3092\u3042\u305F\u3063\u3066\u307F\u307E\u3057\u305F\u306E\u3002\n\u77E5\u308C\u3070\u77E5\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3001\u935B\u51B6\u306F\u5965\u6DF1\u3044\u6280\u8853\u3067\u3059\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ve been reviewing related literature since then.\nThe more I learn, the more I realize how profound the art of smithing is."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3088\u306D\uFF01\u3000\u7D30\u304B\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306F\u5206\u304B\u3093\u306A\u3044\u3051\u3069\n\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u3082\u6253\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3068\u304D\u306F\u697D\u3057\u3044\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right!? I might not understand all the details,\nbut I really enjoy smithing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3001\u4E0D\u601D\u8B70\u3067\u3059\u308F\u306D\u3002\u6DF7\u3058\u308A\u3051\u306E\u3042\u308B\n\u8106\u3044\u9244\u304C\u3001\u935B\u9020\u3068\u3044\u3046\u904E\u7A0B\u3092\u7D4C\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed, it\u0027s quite fascinating. How impure,\nbrittle iron through the forging process..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u53E9\u304D\u3001\u4F38\u3070\u3055\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3067\u4E0D\u7D14\u7269\u304C\u9664\u53BB\u3055\u308C\u3001\n\u5185\u90E8\u7D50\u6676\u304C\u6574\u3044\u3001\u5F37\u976D\u306A\u92FC\u3068\u5316\u3059\u306A\u3093\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Through hammering and stretching, impurities are removed,\nthe internal crystal structure aligns, becoming robust steel."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E9\u30E9\u304C\u8A71\u3059\u3068\u3001\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3002\n\u3000\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u3001\u8208\u5473\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u308B\u3093\u3060\u306A\u3041\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(When Lara talks about it, it sounds just like alchemy.\nShe really is genuinely interested.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u306F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And your hammer..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u660E\u3089\u304B\u306A\u5408\u91D1\u3067\u3042\u308B\u306B\u3082\u304B\u304B\u308F\u3089\u305A\u3001\n\u4E2D\u5FC3\u90E8\u307E\u3067\u30E0\u30E9\u306A\u304F\u8ABF\u548C\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Despite being an obvious alloy, it maintains perfect\nhomogeneity throughout its core."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u3001\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u5353\u8D8A\u3057\u305F\u6280\u8853\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This demonstrates truly exceptional craftsmanship."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3041\u3041\u3041\u3041\uFF01\n\u305D\u3053\u307E\u3067\u898B\u629C\u304F\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3001\u3059\u3054\u3044\u3088\uFF01\n\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wooow!\nYou can tell all that just by looking!?\nBut..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u306E\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What is it, Izana?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3055\u304B\u30E9\u30E9\u304C\u935B\u3048\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you going to forge, Lara?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3055\u304B\u3001\u30E9\u30E9\u304C\u935B\u3048\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you going to forge, Lara?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3002\u305F\u3060\u3057\u3001\u935B\u9020\u3078\u306E\u7406\u89E3\u304C\u6DF1\u307E\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u9053\u5177\u306B\u5FDC\u7528\u3067\u304D\u308B\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, but a deeper understanding of forging might\nhelp me create better tools."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u30C0\u30E0\u306E\u6C11\u304C\u512A\u308C\u305F\u9053\u5177\u3092\u5F97\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u3088\u308A\u826F\u3044\u751F\u6D3B\u3092\u9001\u308C\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3082\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If the people of my Kingdom have access to superior tools,\nthey can lead better lives."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u3063\u304B\u3002\u30E9\u30E9\u81EA\u8EAB\u3082\u8208\u5473\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u3000\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u30C0\u30E0\u306E\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306E\u305F\u3081\u3067\u3082\u3042\u308B\u3093\u3060\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I see. She\u0027s interested herself, but she\u0027s also\nthinking about everyone in her Kingdom.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3055\u304B\u30E9\u30E9\u304C\u5F1F\u5B50\u5165\u308A\u3059\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you going to become an apprentice?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3055\u304B\u30E9\u30E9\u304C\u5F1F\u5B50\u5165\u308A\u3059\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you going to become an apprentice?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9B45\u529B\u7684\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u5426\u3081\u307E\u305B\u3093\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I must admit, the idea is appealing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u306F\u3042\u304F\u307E\u3067\u3082\u738B\u2026\u2026\n\u5F79\u5272\u304C\u7570\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "However, I am first and foremost a ruler...\nOur roles are different."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6280\u8853\u306E\u4F1A\u5F97\u3092\u76EE\u6307\u3059\u6C11\u306E\u529B\u3068\u306A\u308A\u3001\n\u5B66\u3073\u306B\u5C02\u5FF5\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u5F8C\u62BC\u3057\u3059\u308B\u3064\u3082\u308A\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I intend to support those who wish to master these skills,\nensuring they can focus on their studies."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u5F1F\u5B50\u3092\u53D6\u308B\u306E\u304B\u805E\u3044\u3066\u305F\u3093\u3060\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(So that\u0027s why she was asking about apprentices.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D20\u6750\u306E\u3042\u3066\u306F\u3042\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you have sources for materials?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D20\u6750\u306E\u3042\u3066\u306F\u3042\u308B\u306E\uFF1F\n\u7BA1\u7406\u3068\u304B\u8272\u3005\u3001\u5927\u5909\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you have sources for materials?\nManaging that can be really tough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4EF0\u308B\u901A\u308A\u3001\n\u8077\u4EBA\u306E\u7E4B\u304C\u308A\u306B\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3044\u304F\u306E\u306F\u56F0\u96E3\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed, it is difficult to establish connections\nwithin the artisan community."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u521D\u3081\u306F\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u81EA\u3089\u63A1\u53D6\u3059\u308B\u3064\u3082\u308A\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I intend to gather materials myself at first."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E26\u884C\u3057\u3066\u3001\u8077\u4EBA\u3084\u7D44\u5408\u3068\u826F\u597D\u306A\u95A2\u4FC2\u3092\u7BC9\u3051\u3070\n\u6B21\u7B2C\u306B\u5165\u624B\u65B9\u6CD5\u3082\u5E83\u304C\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While building good relationships with craftsmen and guilds,\nI expect procurement options will gradually expand."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9\u3001\u5909\u308F\u3063\u305F\u3088\u306D\u3002\n\u524D\u306F\u7D20\u6750\u3092\u72EC\u5360\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u3066\u305F\u306E\u306B\u3055",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027ve changed, Lara.\nYou used to try to monopolize materials."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u3002\u610F\u5730\u60AA\u3067\u3059\u3053\u3068\u3002\n\u3067\u3059\u304C\u2026\u2026\u3075\u3075\u3001\u8AB0\u304B\u3055\u3093\u306E\u305B\u3044\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, how unkind.\nBut... *giggle* I suppose someone is to blame for that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u3001\u3053\u3061\u3089\u3092\n\u304A\u6301\u3061\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3044\u3066\u3082\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\u3066\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way, would you mind\ncarrying this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3063\u304D\u3044\u7BB1\u3060\u306D\u30FC\u3002\u4F55\u304C\u5165\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s a big box. What\u0027s inside..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u898B\u305F\u76EE\u3088\u308A\u3001\u305A\u3063\u3068\u91CD\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa! It\u0027s way heavier than it looks!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u306E\u5B9F\u9A13\u5185\u5BB9\u3092\u307E\u3068\u3081\u305F\u8CC7\u6599\u3068\u3001\n\u305D\u308C\u306B\u4F34\u3063\u3066\u8A66\u4F5C\u3057\u305F\u5408\u91D1\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It contains documentation of my experiments,\nalong with sample alloys I\u0027ve created."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\uFF1F\u3000\u306A\u3093\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What for?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u304A\u7236\u69D8\u304B\u3089\u306F\u3001\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u30C0\u30E0\u306E\u8FB2\u5177\u3092\n\u935B\u3048\u308B\u6280\u8853\u3092\u5B66\u3073\u305F\u3044\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wish to learn from your father about the techniques\nfor forging farming tools for my Kingdom."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u786C\u304F\u3001\u7C98\u308A\u5F37\u3044\u3060\u3051\u3067\u306A\u304F\u3001\n\u9306\u3073\u3084\u8150\u98DF\u306B\u5F37\u3044\u92FC\u304C\u7406\u60F3\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The ideal steel should be hard and resilient,\nwhile also resistant to rust and corrosion."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u3001\u307E\u305A\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u306B\n\u8FD1\u3044\u3082\u306E\u304C\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u304B\u8A66\u3057\u3066\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As a start, I\u0027ve been attempting to create\nsomething similar to your hammer."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u53D6\u308A\u6025\u304E\uFF12\uFF10\u7A2E\u307B\u3069\u7528\u610F\u3057\u3001\u30EC\u30B7\u30D4\u3068\n\u8010\u4E45\u5B9F\u9A13\u306E\u7D50\u679C\u3092\u307E\u3068\u3081\u305F\u3082\u306E\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ve prepared about 20 varieties, along with recipes\nand durability test results..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u5206\u539A\u3044\u8CC7\u6599\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You mean all these thick documents!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u8FB2\u5177\u306B\u5411\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308B\u914D\u5408\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3001\n\u3054\u610F\u898B\u3092\u304A\u805E\u304B\u305B\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u305F\u3044\u306E\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I\u0027d like your opinion on which compositions\nwould be suitable for farming tools."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u304A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Izana?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3054\u8FF7\u60D1\u3060\u3063\u305F\u304B\u3057\u3089\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps I\u0027m being a bother?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3073\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3057\u3066\u308B\u3060\u3051",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just surprised"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3046\u3093\u3001\u3073\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3057\u3066\u308B\u3060\u3051",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I\u0027m just surprised."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9\u304C\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\n\u4E00\u6D41\u306A\u306E\u306F\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3088\u3002\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I knew you were a first-rate alchemist,\nbut still..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308C\u304B\u3089\u6570\u65E5\u3067\u7528\u610F\u3059\u308B\u91CF\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3088\u306D\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is way too much work for just a few days!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3002\u9244\u306F\u71B1\u3044\u3046\u3061\u306B\u6253\u3066\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*giggle* They say strike while the iron is hot, correct?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u306E\u63A2\u7A76\u5FC3\u306B\u706B\u3092\u3064\u3051\u305F\u306E\u306F\u3001\n\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3067\u3059\u308F\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re the one who ignited my curiosity,\nIzana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306A\u3068\u3053\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3093\u3060\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re a bit like Resna"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u610F\u5916\u306B\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306A\u3068\u3053\u304C\n\u30E9\u30E9\u306B\u3082\u3042\u308B\u3093\u3060\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Surprisingly, you\u0027re kind of like Resna\nin some ways."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u71B1\u4E2D\u3059\u308B\u3068\u6B62\u307E\u3089\u306A\u304F\u306A\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u2026\u2026\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3063\u3066\u3001\u307F\u3093\u306A\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Getting so absorbed that you can\u0027t stop...\nAre all alchemists like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u308A\u308F\u3051\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306F\u3001\u5E38\u4EBA\u4EE5\u4E0A\u306E\n\u96C6\u4E2D\u529B\u3092\u767A\u63EE\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna in particular seems to possess\nan extraordinary level of focus."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u306B\u3082\u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u3072\u305F\u3080\u304D\u3055\u3092\n\u898B\u3044\u51FA\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u308B\u3068\u306F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To think you\u0027d find similarities between\nher dedication and mine..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3002\u5149\u6804\u3067\u3057\u3066\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*giggle* I\u0027m honored."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u52C9\u5F37\u304C\u5F97\u610F\u306A\u3093\u3060\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re good at studying"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9\u306F\u52C9\u5F37\u304C\u5F97\u610F\u306A\u3093\u3060\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re really good at studying."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306F\u82E6\u624B\u306A\u307B\u3046\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u5206\u539A\u3044\u8CC7\u6599\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3068\u3066\u3082\u4F5C\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m not very good at it myself,\nI could never make such detailed documents."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5426\u5B9A\u306F\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304C\u3001\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3063\u305F\u4F5C\u696D\u306F\n\u521D\u3081\u3066\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While I won\u0027t deny that, it\u0027s simply because\nI\u0027m familiar with this kind of work."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3001\u305F\u3068\u3048\u3070\u2026\u2026\n\u672C\u3092\u66F8\u3044\u305F\u3068\u304D\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, like when I wrote that book,\nfor instance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F53\u6642\u306F\u3042\u308C\u3067\u3082\u3001\n\u82E6\u5FC3\u3057\u305F\u7B87\u6240\u3060\u3089\u3051\u3067\u3057\u305F\u306E\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even then, I struggled with\nmany parts of it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u305D\u3046\u3002\u3053\u308C\u3060\u3051\u3068\u306F\u7533\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh yes, that\u0027s not all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u738B\u90FD\u3067\u5305\u3093\u3067\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\u306E\u3002\n\u3053\u3061\u3089\u3082\u3001\u304A\u6301\u3061\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I had this wrapped in the capital.\nPlease, take this as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3001\u3053\u308C\u306F\u8D85\u9AD8\u7D1A\u5E97\u306E\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\uFF5E\uFF5E\uFF5E\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u3082\u98DF\u3079\u305F\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Th-these are sweets from that super fancy shop~!?\nI want to eat them!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\u3066\u3088\u3002\u305F\u3060\u3057\u3001\u6210\u529F\u5831\u916C\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please do. However, they\u0027re a reward for success."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u7236\u69D8\u3068\u306E\u304A\u8A71\u306F\u3001\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u304B\u304B\u3063\u3066\u304A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The discussion with your father\ndepends on you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5FC5\u305A\u3001\u3068\u308A\u306A\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u307E\u3057\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You must ensure it goes well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D76\u5BFE\u306B\u3084\u308A\u9042\u3052\u3066\u307F\u305B\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll definitely succeed!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u30FB\u30B3\u30B3\u30B7\u30E5\u30AB\u3001\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u627F\u3063\u305F\u3088\uFF01\n\u7D76\u5BFE\u306B\u3084\u308A\u9042\u3052\u3066\u307F\u305B\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana Kokoschka, at your service!\nI\u0027ll definitely make it happen!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u983C\u3082\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u308F\u3002\u6210\u529F\u3057\u305F\u6681\u306B\u306F\u3001\n\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u5206\u3082\u7528\u610F\u3057\u3066\u3001\u7686\u3067\u98DF\u3079\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How reliable. Once we succeed,\nI\u0027ll prepare some for Resna too, and we can all enjoy them together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u3044\u3044\u306E\u30FC\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really!? Is that okay!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3002\u529F\u52B4\u8005\u306B\u306F\u50CD\u304D\u306E\u5206\u3060\u3051\n\u52B4\u3044\u3092\u4E0E\u3048\u308B\u306E\u304C\u541B\u4E3B\u306E\u5F79\u76EE\u3067\u3057\u3066\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. It\u0027s a ruler\u0027s duty to reward\nthose who contribute according to their efforts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3001\u795D\u3044\u306E\u5E2D\u3067\u3059\u3082\u306E\u3002\n\u4E26\u3076\u5F69\u308A\u306F\u591A\u3044\u307B\u3046\u304C\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, for a celebration,\nthe more colors on the table, the merrier."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3002\u5927\u3044\u306B\u671F\u5F85\u3057\u3066\u3089\u3057\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*giggle* I have high expectations."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u7236\u3055\u3093\u3073\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3046\u304B\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dad might be surprised"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026\n\u304A\u7236\u3055\u3093\u3073\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3046\u304B\u3082\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sure, but...\nDad might be really surprised, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9\u306E\u8CC7\u6599\u3068\u8A66\u4F5C\u54C1\u306E\u71B1\u610F\u304C\u3059\u3054\u3044\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u5F35\u308A\u5408\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u3001\u8A71\u3059\u3069\u3053\u308D\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your enthusiasm with these documents and samples is amazing.\nHe might get too excited to even talk properly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3001\u71B1\u3044\u610F\u898B\u3092\u4EA4\u308F\u3059\u3053\u3068\u304C\n\u3067\u304D\u308B\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you suggesting we might be able\nto have a passionate discussion?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u306F\u3001\u3055\u3089\u306B\u77E5\u8B58\u3092\u6DF1\u3081\u3066\u304A\u304B\u306D\u3070\n\u5931\u793C\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3082\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I must deepen my knowledge further\nto avoid being discourteous."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8B39\u3093\u3067\u3001\u6311\u307E\u305B\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u307E\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall humbly accept this challenge."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u304B\u306A\u2026\u2026\n\u3000\u624B\u5408\u308F\u305B\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u304D\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Somehow...\nthis is starting to feel like a duel.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3069\u3046\u3059\u308B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What if he\u0027s not there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3044\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3069\u3046\u3059\u308B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it. But what if he\u0027s not there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3080\u2026\u2026\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3042\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u65E5\u3092\u6539\u3081\u308B\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u3059\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... If it were just me,\nI would come back another day, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u5EA6\u3082\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u306E\u624B\u3092\u7169\u308F\u305B\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\n\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3082\u306E\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That would mean troubling you\nmultiple times..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306A\u3089\u3001\u624B\u571F\u7523\u306E\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\u3092\u98DF\u3079\u3066\u3044\u3044\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In that case, can I eat the sweets?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\uFF1F\u3000\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u3053\u3061\u3089\u306F\u6210\u529F\u5831\u916C\u3068\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eh? But these are meant to be a reward for..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u304F\u308C\u308B\u306A\u3089\u3001\u4F55\u5EA6\u3067\u3082\u53D6\u308A\u6B21\u3050\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you give them to me now, I\u0027ll help as many times as needed!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u2026\u2026\uFF01\u3000\u52A9\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3059\u308F\u3002\n\u3044\u304F\u3089\u3067\u3082\u53EC\u3057\u4E0A\u304C\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my...! That would be most helpful.\nPlease, help yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u3063\u305F\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yay~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u306B\u304B\u304F\u3001\u30E9\u30E9\u306E\u71B1\u610F\u306F\u3088\u30FC\u304F\u4F1D\u308F\u3063\u305F\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Anyway, I really understand your enthusiasm now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u660E\u65E5\u306B\u3067\u3082\u884C\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308B\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u7D9A\u5831\u3092\u671F\u5F85\u3057\u3066\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll go tomorrow,\nso look forward to good news!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u3053\u3068\u3055\u3089\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\n\u983C\u3082\u3057\u304F\u611F\u3058\u307E\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Today especially,\nI find myself deeply impressed by you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u304B\u983C\u307F\u307E\u3059\u308F\u306D\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m counting on you, Izana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E9\u30E9\u304C\u304A\u7236\u3055\u3093\u306B\u8208\u5473\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u3092\u983C\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u60F3\u50CF\u3082\u3057\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I never imagined Lara would be interested in Dad\u0027s work\nand rely on me like this.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3059\u3063\u3054\u304F\u30EF\u30AF\u30EF\u30AF\u3057\u3066\u308B\uFF01\n\u3000\u3088\u30FC\u3057\u3002\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3046\u305E\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But I\u0027m super excited!\nAlright, time to give it my all!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]